                {
                    "id": "632260101",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "Hello there! Need a few more Omni-Ubiquity Nets, do you?"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6322602",
            "initDialog": "632260201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "632260201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I'd like to buy some."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6322603",
            "initDialog": "632260301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "632260301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "So, about the Omni-Ubiquity Net..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "632260302",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "My research into these nets is still ongoing, but I've got to say that I'm not making any progress at all."
                },
                {
                    "id": "632260303",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "I've not been able to achieve the levels of sturdiness, utility, or any other parameter for that matter, that Sango told me were possible..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "632260304",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "Where did we go wrong, I wonder..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "632260305",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "I—I mean, Sango couldn't have remembered that onmyoudou technique wrongly... Right?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "632260306",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "I'll go ask her when the opportunity arises, just to be sure..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6322604",
            "initDialog": "632260401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "632260401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "See you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "632260402",
                    "speaker": "Wakamurasaki",
                    "text": "See you. Take care!"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
